asr-001655
01:41:08.610 --> 01:41:21.510
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: ng notice po sa mga agencies upang sila ay magpaliwanag kung bakit hindi nila

asr-001656
01:41:21.510 --> 01:41:25.870
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: nasusunod, natutupad yung requirements ng batas.

asr-001657
01:41:27.610 --> 01:41:31.850
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Meron na po bang mga paliwanag? Do we have anything na?

asr-001658
01:41:31.850 --> 01:41:35.500
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Ongoing po, kailan po?

asr-001658-split-2
01:41:35.500 --> 01:41:41.710
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: This year po namin nagawa yun. So siguro ongoing po, wala po kasi akong data sa ngayon.

asr-001659
01:41:41.830 --> 01:41:47.410
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Ongoing po yung pasok siguro ng mga compliance ng mga government agencies dito.

asr-001660
01:41:48.090 --> 01:41:52.550
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: We'll just provide update po kung ano man po yung merong available sa amin sa ngayon.

asr-001661
01:41:52.550 --> 01:41:58.490
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Yes po. Siguro ang pakiusap ko na lamang po sa CHR na maging medyo ano po tayo,

asr-001662
01:41:58.650 --> 01:42:01.830
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: stricto siguro this time kasi antagal-tagal.

asr-001663
01:42:01.850 --> 01:42:06.750
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: na po nung batas. Hindi po nako-comply talaga yung nakasaad doon.

asr-001664
01:42:06.810 --> 01:42:11.850
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Maybe it's about time that maging seryoso po tayo sa paghahabol sa mga ahensya

asr-001665
01:42:11.850 --> 01:42:14.110
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: to comply with the provisions of the law.

asr-001666
01:42:14.530 --> 01:42:22.350
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So my last question would be, Madam Speaker, yung budget cut from your original proposal

asr-001667
01:42:22.350 --> 01:42:28.490
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: to the NEP level, will that significantly affect the function and role of the CHR

asr-001668
01:42:28.490 --> 01:42:30.610
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: as the gender ombud?

asr-001669
01:42:31.850 --> 01:42:40.290
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Bago ko lang po sagutin, balikan ko lamang po yung kanina una on the compliance of government agencies.

asr-001670
01:42:41.310 --> 01:42:50.810
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: So ang isa pong strategy na ginawa ng commission ng CHR at ng PCW is we come up with a memorandum of agreement

asr-001671
01:42:50.810 --> 01:42:59.650
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: para kami po ay we can jointly monitor the compliance of these government agencies under the Magna Carta of Women.

asr-001672
01:42:59.970 --> 01:43:01.650
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Ngayon po dun sa inyong...

asr-001673
01:43:01.850 --> 01:43:10.520
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: sumunod na katanungan, as I said, katulad po ng mga tanong kanina na nauna,

asr-001674
01:43:11.420 --> 01:43:19.140
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: of course, maapektuhan po yung aming serbisyo dahil sa budget and resources.

asr-001675
01:43:19.420 --> 01:43:23.840
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Dahil patuloy, ito po ay regular nang naging problema ng komisyon

asr-001676
01:43:23.840 --> 01:43:30.220
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: and we learned to adapt, actually, kung paano namin gagamitin yung meager resources of the commission.

asr-001677
01:43:30.220 --> 01:43:32.380
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: But of course, it would help.

asr-001678
01:43:33.800 --> 01:43:38.940
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: if the Congress would grant us additional budget for this.

asr-001679
01:43:39.740 --> 01:43:45.820
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Especially kung dedicated po, ang budget po ay dedicated for the compliance as the gender ombud,

asr-001680
01:43:46.720 --> 01:43:48.660
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: mas makakatulong po ng gusto.

asr-001681
01:43:49.720 --> 01:43:56.120
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: In fact, sa mga previous budget deliberation in previous years po,

asr-001682
01:43:57.000 --> 01:43:59.200
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: isa po ito sa mga hinahilayit ng komisyon,

asr-001683
01:43:59.200 --> 01:44:03.540
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: yung mga special laws providing additional mandates.

asr-001684
01:44:03.800 --> 01:44:08.300
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: to the commission na wala pong additional budget na binibigay.

asr-001685
01:44:11.300 --> 01:44:11.800
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Yun po.

asr-001686
01:44:11.800 --> 01:44:19.080
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Patuloy pa rin namin hihingin, kung sakali pong, if you would be generous enough to grant the CHR budget

asr-001687
01:44:19.080 --> 01:44:23.180
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: for these special laws or special mandates provided to us.

asr-001688
01:44:24.680 --> 01:44:26.220
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Maraming salamat po, Madam Chair.

asr-001689
01:44:26.220 --> 01:44:31.080
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Madam Chair, I therefore join our colleagues in their call

asr-001690
01:44:31.080 --> 01:44:33.740
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: to restore the original proposed budget.

asr-001691
01:44:33.740 --> 01:44:35.740
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Maraming maraming salamat po.

asr-001692
01:44:35.740 --> 01:44:37.740
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Maraming salamat po.

asr-001693
01:44:37.740 --> 01:44:45.740
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Thank you, Representative Iris Montes, for your support sa increase pa rin ng CHR budget.

asr-001694
01:44:45.740 --> 01:44:53.740
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Next on line po, from minority, Representative Sara Ilago.

asr-001695
01:44:53.740 --> 01:44:56.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Madam Chair.

asr-001696
01:44:56.740 --> 01:44:58.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nais kong malaman kung ano ang

asr-001697
01:44:58.740 --> 01:44:59.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: original

asr-001698
01:44:59.740 --> 01:45:00.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: proposal

asr-001699
01:45:00.740 --> 01:45:01.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at mga nakasama

asr-001700
01:45:01.740 --> 01:45:02.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa NEP na pondo

asr-001701
01:45:02.740 --> 01:45:03.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa

asr-001702
01:45:03.740 --> 01:45:11.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Human Rights Protection Program, Human Rights Promotion Program, at Human Rights Policy Advisory Program.

asr-001703
01:45:16.410 --> 01:45:18.410
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Chairman Papalito, you are recognized.

asr-001704
01:45:18.830 --> 01:45:19.610
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-001705
01:45:19.610 --> 01:45:40.940
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: So ang budget po na nasama sa NEP for personal service, P718,805,000 yung pong binigay sa NEP.

asr-001706
01:45:40.940 --> 01:45:46.420
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: For MOOE, P492,454,000.

asr-001707
01:45:47.460 --> 01:45:50.940
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: And for RLIP,

asr-001708
01:45:51.140 --> 01:45:57.700
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: 61,333,000 or a total of 1,272,000,000.

asr-001709
01:45:58.120 --> 01:46:03.720
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Kung ang tinatanong po natin ay yung distribution nito sa mga core services.

asr-001710
01:46:03.720 --> 01:46:12.200
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: So for majority po kasi ng budget personal service.

asr-001711
01:46:13.200 --> 01:46:21.060
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: So for the protection, ang allocated budget po ay,

asr-001712
01:46:22.620 --> 01:46:26.720
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: P379,531,000.

asr-001713
01:46:27.280 --> 01:46:32.440
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Then for Human Rights Promotion Program, P90,480,000.

asr-001714
01:46:33.500 --> 01:46:38.800
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: For Human Rights Policy Program, P79,342,000.

asr-001715
01:46:38.800 --> 01:46:47.260
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: And then for Jail Visitation, P28,086,000.

asr-001716
01:46:47.940 --> 01:46:52.040
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Bahagi po siya ng total ng protection program.

asr-001717
01:46:55.050 --> 01:46:57.170
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat sa kasagutan.

asr-001718
01:46:57.650 --> 01:47:03.630
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At marami po dito ay napakalayo doon sa original proposal ng CHR

asr-001719
01:47:03.630 --> 01:47:07.390
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para magampana ng buong-buo ang kanilang napakahalagang trabaho.

asr-001720
01:47:07.390 --> 01:47:14.650
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po, nais ko pong malaman rin kung yung mga pondo, halimbawa,

asr-001721
01:47:14.810 --> 01:47:16.930
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng mga mahalagang centers natin.

asr-001722
01:47:17.050 --> 01:47:22.390
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Halimbawa po yung Child Rights Center, Center for Gender Equality and Women's Human Rights,

asr-001723
01:47:23.170 --> 01:47:24.650
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Center for Disability.

asr-001724
01:47:25.050 --> 01:47:30.810
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At lahat po ng ating mga centers sa ilalim po ng CHR.

asr-001725
01:47:31.390 --> 01:47:34.930
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Paano humaapektuhan ang trabaho ng mga centers na ito?

asr-001726
01:47:35.350 --> 01:47:40.910
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At dahil hindi po naibibigay ng buong po yung hinihiling natin na kinakailangan

asr-001727
01:47:40.910 --> 01:47:45.030
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa pagampan ng atungkulin para sa susunod na taon?

asr-001728
01:47:46.250 --> 01:47:51.090
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Unang-una po, iyong pong budget, kung tinatanong niyo po sa ating mga centers,

asr-001729
01:47:52.610 --> 01:47:54.690
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: nakapaloob po siya doon sa Human Rights Policy Program.

asr-001730
01:47:54.690 --> 01:48:04.590
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Sa Human Rights Policy Program po ay dalawa po yung core functions na ginagawa dito.

asr-001731
01:48:05.210 --> 01:48:14.370
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Ito po yung Policy Linkages Offices, kung ito yung gumagawa ng monitoring activities

asr-001732
01:48:14.370 --> 01:48:17.650
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: and international engagement.

asr-001733
01:48:20.120 --> 01:48:21.840
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: At pangalawa, yung pong center.

asr-001734
01:48:21.840 --> 01:48:24.840
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: So, naghahati po sila doon sa budget na...

asr-001735
01:48:26.160 --> 01:48:28.380
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: 79,342,000.

asr-001736
01:48:29.660 --> 01:48:31.160
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Yung pong mga...

asr-001737
01:48:31.820 --> 01:48:36.940
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Sa pondong ito, kaya naman pong tugunan yung mga existing activities and programs.

asr-001738
01:48:37.220 --> 01:48:39.440
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Pero, hindi po tayo...

asr-001739
01:48:39.440 --> 01:48:43.620
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Hindi po natin kakayani mag-introduce ng bagong mga...

asr-001740
01:48:43.620 --> 01:48:46.700
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: or expansion ng mga existing activities.

asr-001741
01:48:47.800 --> 01:48:52.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Walang expansion, Madam Chair, pero meron po kayong naging proposal.

asr-001742
01:48:52.680 --> 01:48:53.380
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Meron po.

asr-001743
01:48:53.380 --> 01:48:54.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para mapalawak.

asr-001744
01:48:55.000 --> 01:48:56.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At mapagyaman pa ang kanilang...

asr-001745
01:48:56.160 --> 01:49:00.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Inais ko rin pong mabanggit na rin, for the record,

asr-001746
01:49:00.800 --> 01:49:03.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang Center for Disability and Health-Related Rights

asr-001747
01:49:03.480 --> 01:49:06.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at ang Center for Social Justice and Humanitarian Protection.

asr-001748
01:49:07.140 --> 01:49:09.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Abukad pa po sa napakahalaga na Child Rights Center

asr-001749
01:49:09.580 --> 01:49:11.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at Center for Gender Equality and Women's Human Rights.

asr-001750
01:49:12.340 --> 01:49:16.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mahalaga ito, Madam Chair, dahil sa mga gawain din natin dito sa Kongreso.

asr-001751
01:49:17.780 --> 01:49:19.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Napakahalagang references.

asr-001752
01:49:19.100 --> 01:49:22.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung mga nilalabas ko ng mga situation reports,

asr-001753
01:49:22.680 --> 01:49:25.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: assessment, monitoring, evaluation,

asr-001754
01:49:26.160 --> 01:49:32.830
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: policy analysis na nilalabas ng mga centers na ito

asr-001755
01:49:32.830 --> 01:49:38.190
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: bilang reference sa mga ginagawa natin ng mga panukala dito sa Kongreso.

asr-001756
01:49:38.410 --> 01:49:43.210
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya ho, lahat ng maibibigay natin na pagtulak at pagsisika

asr-001757
01:49:43.210 --> 01:49:48.490
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para matugunan yung mga hindi na bigyan ng pondo sa NEP.

asr-001758
01:49:48.850 --> 01:49:53.090
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At dapat ho gawin ng committee and appropriations na bigyan ng prioridad ang mga ito.

asr-001759
01:49:53.310 --> 01:49:57.090
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, Madam Chair, tungkol ho sa mga naisagawang community,

asr-001760
01:49:57.470 --> 01:50:00.930
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mga community dialogues, mga community-based dialogues.

asr-001761
01:50:02.490 --> 01:50:07.910
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang mga regional at local, ang mga regional offices po ba natin sa buong bansa

asr-001762
01:50:07.910 --> 01:50:10.650
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay nakapagsagawa ng ganitong tipo ng mga dialogues?

asr-001763
01:50:12.130 --> 01:50:13.950
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Yes po, Madam Chair, Your Honor.

asr-001764
01:50:14.290 --> 01:50:18.630
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Kasama po sa mga regular activities ng ating mga regional offices,

asr-001765
01:50:18.850 --> 01:50:20.050
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: ang community-based dialogues.

asr-001766
01:50:23.250 --> 01:50:27.070
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ilan po yung mga participants at mga naaabot ng mga dialogues na ito?

asr-001767
01:50:27.070 --> 01:50:29.330
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At kung meron din kayong information,

asr-001768
01:50:29.970 --> 01:50:37.430
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa mga NGOs, civil society organizations na naaabot natin pagdating sa mga diyalogo na ito.

asr-001769
01:50:37.870 --> 01:50:42.810
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mahalaga ito, Madam Chair, kasi ito yung magtitiyak na nakalapat sa katotohanan

asr-001770
01:50:42.810 --> 01:50:48.130
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung ano man yung mga programa, proyekto, aktividad na sinasagawa ng CHR,

asr-001771
01:50:48.730 --> 01:50:51.350
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lalong-lalo na sa pagtindig para sa karapatang pantao.

asr-001772
01:50:52.350 --> 01:50:58.670
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: For 2025 po, nakapagsagawa po ang komisyon ng 34 community-based dialogues.

asr-001773
01:50:59.970 --> 01:51:06.610
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Sa ngayon po, as of June 2026, mayroon na po tayo nagawang 16 community-based dialogues.

asr-001774
01:51:06.950 --> 01:51:11.750
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Hindi po ako makapagbigay ng actual na bilang ng kung ilan yung participants,

asr-001775
01:51:12.090 --> 01:51:19.870
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: but based on our promotion activities, kasi kasama po sa mga CBDs namin ay promotion activities,

asr-001776
01:51:20.590 --> 01:51:29.910
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: meron po kaming talang 122,950 individuals who participated in promotion activities.

asr-001777
01:51:29.970 --> 01:51:38.430
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: In 2025, sa ngayon po, as of June 2026, meron na pong 51,716 individuals.

asr-001778
01:51:39.990 --> 01:51:43.750
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Madam Chair, at marami tayong naaabot.

asr-001779
01:51:43.910 --> 01:51:49.870
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero kung itutumbas din natin ito, kung makikita po natin yung ulat ng CHR para sa Human Rights Education Program,

asr-001780
01:51:50.450 --> 01:51:57.270
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: malaki talaga na limitation yung kulang na pondo pagdating sa pag-abot sa mas malawak pa.

asr-001781
01:51:57.270 --> 01:51:59.310
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi bagamat marami, nasa libo na.

asr-001782
01:51:59.970 --> 01:52:04.690
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero milyong-milyong mga Pilipino pa yung hindi naaabot ng ganitong tipo ng mga programa.

asr-001783
01:52:04.910 --> 01:52:10.030
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya nais ko rin malaman kung may pag-uusap ba sa ngayon sa DepEd, sa CHED,

asr-001784
01:52:10.270 --> 01:52:16.690
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at sa mga institutions natin na ma-integrate din yung Human Rights Education.

asr-001785
01:52:17.810 --> 01:52:23.310
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Alam ko, Madam Chair, may mga panukala dito sa Kongreso para ma-institutionalize ang Human Rights Education,

asr-001786
01:52:23.310 --> 01:52:29.610
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pero sa bahagi ngayon ng CHR, meron na ba tayong mga existing na mga partnerships sa iba't ibang institutions

asr-001787
01:52:29.610 --> 01:52:33.210
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para mapalakas ang ating Human Rights Education Program?

asr-001788
01:52:33.670 --> 01:52:41.930
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Unang-una po, Madam Chair, Your Honor, unang-una po, patuloy po yung ugnayan natin with the Commission on Higher Education

asr-001789
01:52:41.930 --> 01:52:56.750
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: and DepEd on Human Rights Education, including the review of the curriculum ng mga kurso.

asr-001790
01:52:56.750 --> 01:52:57.750
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: So, on the part of the...

asr-001791
01:52:59.610 --> 01:53:05.950
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: On the part of the Commission on Human Rights, yun po palang ugnayan na yun with the DepEd and CHED

asr-001792
01:53:05.950 --> 01:53:13.810
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: ay kasama po ang may initiative po ang Commission on Human Rights as well as HRBBMC

asr-001793
01:53:13.810 --> 01:53:17.270
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: para maging part ng curriculum.

asr-001794
01:53:18.250 --> 01:53:26.850
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: On, of course, for MEMCOM, yung pong martial law, ang CHR naman as the general concept of human rights.

asr-001795
01:53:26.850 --> 01:53:28.850
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: On the part of...

asr-001796
01:53:29.610 --> 01:53:39.610
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: On the part of the Commission on Human Rights, we have existing partnership with higher educational institutions all over the Philippines.

asr-001797
01:53:40.570 --> 01:53:45.030
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Ang tawag po namin sa kanila ay Center for Human Rights Education.

asr-001798
01:53:46.270 --> 01:53:53.630
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Partnership po ito with this higher educational institution for human rights promotion and research.

asr-001799
01:53:55.450 --> 01:53:57.630
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Then, we also have...

asr-001800
01:53:57.630 --> 01:54:08.210
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Ongoing discussion with the Philippine Association of Law Schools on the inclusion of...

asr-001801
01:54:08.210 --> 01:54:16.150
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Collaboration with the PALS on human rights activities and promotions.

asr-001802
01:54:16.750 --> 01:54:27.770
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Chair, hingin na lang po natin yung ulat na tungkol sa extension of services or outreach efforts po natin

asr-001803
01:54:27.770 --> 01:54:29.230
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para ma-enjoy pa yung...

asr-001804
01:54:29.230 --> 01:54:32.430
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Public at private actors sa human rights education.

asr-001805
01:54:32.890 --> 01:54:38.730
