asr-001806
01:54:38.730 --> 01:54:41.270
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na may kinalaman sa gender-based violence.

asr-001807
01:54:41.810 --> 01:54:47.270
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lahat ho ba ito ay may kinalaman sa state-perpetrated, state-sponsored or condoned

asr-001808
01:54:47.270 --> 01:54:53.170
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: by any means na type ng violence against women and all genders?

asr-001809
01:54:53.630 --> 01:54:54.270
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Hindi po.

asr-001810
01:54:54.270 --> 01:54:59.150
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: So, kailangan natin i-disaggregate yung data.

asr-001811
01:54:59.230 --> 01:55:09.430
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Kasi, halo po ito, merong state actor or state sanctioned or state agent.

asr-001812
01:55:10.030 --> 01:55:15.170
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Meron, karamihan dito actually ay private individuals ang respondents.

asr-001813
01:55:16.250 --> 01:55:26.230
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Pero dahil kasama po sa mandato natin na tignan, yung due diligence, compliance ng ating pamahalaan

asr-001814
01:55:26.230 --> 01:55:29.230
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: on the protection and promotion of human rights.

asr-001815
01:55:29.230 --> 01:55:34.230
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: At kasama po sa inaimbestigaan ng komisyon ito.

asr-001816
01:55:34.330 --> 01:55:42.150
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: So, ang objective would be to determine kung sapat po ba yung mga mekanismo at mga solusyon at tugon

asr-001817
01:55:42.150 --> 01:55:49.150
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: na ginagawaan ng ating pamahalaan sa mga kaso ng paglabag ng karapatan ng kababaihan.

asr-001818
01:55:51.150 --> 01:55:55.090
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Chair, kukunin ho natin yung disaggregated data at tungkol dito.

asr-001819
01:55:55.090 --> 01:55:59.090
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero para sa mga kaso halimbawa na state-perpetrated or state-sponsored,

asr-001820
01:56:00.510 --> 01:56:07.390
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lahat ho ba ng mga kaso na lumalapit sa inyo ay nadidispose po natin agad, na-address po natin agad?

asr-001821
01:56:07.490 --> 01:56:08.870
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: O may mga challenges pa ho?

asr-001822
01:56:09.330 --> 01:56:14.810
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Halimbawa, pag natitiyak natin na mapapatawag ang dapat mapatawag,

asr-001823
01:56:14.970 --> 01:56:18.010
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nagagawa ho ba ito? At meron bang nananagot?

asr-001824
01:56:19.230 --> 01:56:22.570
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Yes po, nagagawa naman po ito at natatapos din agad.

asr-001825
01:56:23.650 --> 01:56:26.630
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Although, katulad nung nabanggit ko kanina, Madam Chair, Your Honor,

asr-001826
01:56:28.410 --> 01:56:30.410
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: tinutukan po ng komisyon yung backlog.

asr-001827
01:56:30.510 --> 01:56:38.190
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: From 1987 to 2025, more than 20,000 or almost 30,000 cases po ito.

asr-001828
01:56:39.630 --> 01:56:52.170
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: So, pagkatapos po yan, mas makakatutok na kami sa mga current cases na nasa around 2,942 cases na lamang po tayo.

asr-001829
01:56:52.830 --> 01:56:59.630
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: So, mas mapapabilis na po yung investigation and conclusion of the investigation of these cases.

asr-001830
01:57:00.510 --> 01:57:07.310
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat po sa paghabon ng backlog at malaki po ang magagawa kung ma-restore yung pondo.

asr-001831
01:57:07.630 --> 01:57:13.810
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi nga lang ma-restore dun sa previously approved, pero matiyak po natin na madadagdagan yung pondo

asr-001832
01:57:13.810 --> 01:57:20.150
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa human rights protection promotion, education, at mga policy-related programs.

asr-001833
01:57:20.670 --> 01:57:28.370
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bilang panghuli po sa kalagayan ng mga human rights defenders, may mga kababaihan po na dumulog at naghahin ng complaint,

asr-001834
01:57:28.370 --> 01:57:30.370
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng reklamo sa harap ng CHR.

asr-001835
01:57:30.510 --> 01:57:40.510
