asr-001843
01:58:21.270 --> 01:58:26.410
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Ang isa po sa mga pinaplano ng komisyon ay isang national preventive mechanism,

asr-001844
01:58:26.410 --> 01:58:28.670
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: national protection mechanism.

asr-001845
01:58:29.390 --> 01:58:30.410
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Tatlo pong pinaplano.

asr-001846
01:58:30.510 --> 01:58:35.310
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Pillars ito ng protection mechanism for human rights defenders.

asr-001847
01:58:36.710 --> 01:58:40.950
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Pillar one would be the early warning system o tawag po namin ay bantay

asr-001848
01:58:40.950 --> 01:58:50.490
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: upang agad-agad naming matukoy ang mga human rights violations at agad din kami makatugon.

asr-001849
01:58:51.430 --> 01:58:55.870
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Ang pangalawa pong pillar nito ay the protection mechanism itself.

asr-001850
01:58:55.870 --> 01:59:00.490
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Yun po yung mga existing activities and programs of the commission.

asr-001851
01:59:01.270 --> 01:59:08.790
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Which include investigation, witness protection and support to victims.

asr-001852
01:59:09.890 --> 01:59:12.890
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: At ang pangatlo po yung national monitoring mechanism

asr-001853
01:59:14.030 --> 01:59:22.030
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: kung saan ang tawag po namin sa pillar na yun ay tugon or gabay.

asr-001854
01:59:24.510 --> 01:59:28.510
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Ang objective po nun ay policy recommendation.

asr-001855
01:59:28.510 --> 01:59:43.630
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Ang objective po ay pulungin ang mga stakeholders including government agencies and civil society

asr-001856
01:59:43.630 --> 01:59:51.650
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: upang pag-usapan kung ano ang problema sa karapatang pantao at hanapan ng solusyon

