Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: The fiscal year 2027 NEP proposes approximately

asr-002589
02:24:19.390 --> 02:24:25.130
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: 9.74 billion for the local government support fund,

asr-002590
02:24:25.130 --> 02:24:29.130
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: support to the Barangay Development Program of the NTF-ELCAC.

asr-002591
02:24:30.330 --> 02:24:32.130
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Considering the scale and geographical,

asr-002592
02:24:32.810 --> 02:24:34.470
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: reach of this program,

asr-002593
02:24:34.470 --> 02:24:41.050
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: what additional demands does its implementation place on CHR monitoring,

asr-002594
02:24:41.050 --> 02:24:43.050
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: investigation,

asr-002595
02:24:43.050 --> 02:24:46.050
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: protection and human rights education functions,

asr-002596
02:24:46.050 --> 02:24:50.570
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: particularly on conflict-affected and remote communities?

asr-002597
02:24:50.570 --> 02:24:53.810
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Based on CHR monitoring and cases,

asr-002598
02:24:53.810 --> 02:24:56.810
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: what requiring human rights risks or concern,

asr-002599
02:24:56.810 --> 02:24:57.810
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: if any,

asr-002600
02:24:57.810 --> 02:25:02.650
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: should Congress consider in reviewing this appropriation?

asr-002601
02:25:02.810 --> 02:25:08.190
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Does CHR have sufficient personnel and operational resources,

asr-002602
02:25:08.190 --> 02:25:10.470
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: especially in its regional offices,

asr-002603
02:25:10.470 --> 02:25:14.070
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: to undertake independent monitoring,

asr-002604
02:25:14.070 --> 02:25:16.010
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: investigate complaints,

asr-002605
02:25:16.010 --> 02:25:20.550
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: assist affected persons and engage communities?

asr-002606
02:25:20.550 --> 02:25:21.470
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: If not,

asr-002607
02:25:21.470 --> 02:25:26.470
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: what specific additional appropriation does the CHR require?

asr-002608
02:25:26.470 --> 02:25:27.730
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: Finally,

asr-002609
02:25:27.730 --> 02:25:28.750
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: what safeguards,

asr-002610
02:25:28.750 --> 02:25:30.310
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: transparency,

asr-002611
02:25:30.310 --> 02:25:32.590
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: measures and reporting requirements,

asr-002612
02:25:32.590 --> 02:25:36.350
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: does the CHR recommend that Congress include

asr-002613
02:25:36.350 --> 02:25:41.670
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: in the relevant appropriations to ensure objective beneficiary selection,

asr-002614
02:25:41.670 --> 02:25:43.470
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: non-discrimination,

asr-002615
02:25:43.470 --> 02:25:44.970
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: due process,

asr-002616
02:25:44.970 --> 02:25:47.790
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: meaningful community participation,

asr-002617
02:25:47.790 --> 02:25:49.910
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: protection against red-tagging,

asr-002618
02:25:49.910 --> 02:25:51.770
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: and retaliation,

asr-002619
02:25:51.770 --> 02:25:52.990
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: effective access,

asr-002620
02:25:52.990 --> 02:25:55.930
Rep. Ma. Cristina Talavera Lopez: and oversight by the CHR?

asr-002621
02:25:56.450 --> 02:25:57.930
