CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: or red-tagging involving malicious utterances or unfounded information

asr-002647
02:28:13.650 --> 02:28:20.010
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: that imputes one's participation in a criminal act or involvement in an ongoing armed conflict,

asr-002648
02:28:20.770 --> 02:28:24.950
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: ultimately impacting the right to life, liberty, security, privacy,

asr-002649
02:28:24.950 --> 02:28:27.510
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: and the freedom of expression and association.

asr-002650
02:28:29.110 --> 02:28:34.350
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: And the staffing and budget,

asr-002651
02:28:34.690 --> 02:28:41.630
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: we reiterate our manifestation a while ago regarding our Tier 2 proposal, Your Honor, Madam Chair.

